   <description>
      <short>
         <en>Fast group member manager: reactivate or manage group members without manual click-work</en>
      </short>
      <long>
         <en>
More Groups speeds up group member management in GLPI. On a Group's Group_User tab,
deactivating a user moves them out of the group's active member list into a
"Deactivated users" list on the same tab, without losing their membership settings
(dynamic, manager, delegatee). Click the activate button on a deactivated user to
bring them straight back into the group.

Massive actions let you activate or deactivate several users at once, and
deactivated members keep their original manager/delegatee/dynamic flags for when
they're reactivated.
         </en>
      </long>
   </description>
